<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CRIIMI MAE started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CRIIMI MAE started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of CRIIMI MAE Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $19 a share.</p>
<p>-- CRIIMI MAE was unchanged at 16-3/8.</p>
